        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esal a ekaru kangolo, apot ngasigerea a Siria kitijikis ngitunga a Yuda ka Yerusalem, taara ngikapolok daang, tangatasi ngiboro lukokaalak tobongioto Damasko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akidioko ngasigerea a Siria, nakaneni abu Ekapolon Akuj nak kesi agogongu na idwangeta ngasigerea a Yuda nakaalak kainyo apot kesi tongero Ekapolon Akuj na erai Akuj kata apaakech. Apon Yoach kirirae a eger kangolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apon ngesi towanae lokojokon. Ani erotokinete ngimoe, apot ngikapolok a arieng a Yoach ngiarei totuko akiar ngesi sodi tatachakineta akitu a lokookeng",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24:25",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "lokookeng;",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Igiritae nagiran nangorok ngache lokookeng; igiritae Naeburaniae talokookeng.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " a Yeoyada alo arai emuron a Akuj. Tonukakinae Yoach lore a Daudi, nakaneni meere nalielin a ngikapolok. ( ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyaritae epei a ngikiliok alu atukete akiar ngesi Sabad lo arai lokookeng a aberu ana anyaritae Chimeas, ana ekitela a Amon. Anyaritae loche Yeosabad lo arai lokookeng a aberu ana anyaritae Chimuris, ana ekitela a Moab.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakiro kata lokookeng a Yoach, ka ngakiro naaronok adwario ani a Yoach ta eger lo abongonokinio ngesi akiduk akai a Akuj, igiritae daang nakitab na isisae ngakiro a ngikapolok. Abu lokookeng lo anyaritae Amasia kilunyokin nados keng toliwor ekapolon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
